VALUES (gen_random_uuid()::text, $q$vr-cooking-game$q$, $q$Rico's Kitchen$q$, $q$A VR cooking game focused on using your hands with kitchen tools and food. It explores physics based interaction and the foundations of a hands-on cooking experience.$q$, $q$Simulation$q$, ARRAY[$q$Virtual Reality$q$, $q$Simulation$q$, $q$Cooking$q$, $q$Unity$q$, $q$XR$q$]::text[], $q$Unity 2022.3, C#, VR Interaction Framework, OpenXR, Oculus XR Plugin, Input System$q$, $q$2026$q$, $q$🍳$q$, $q$#0f766e$q$, true, 11, $q$GAME$q$, $q$PERSONAL$q$, $q$Solo game and XR developer$q$, $q$I set up the VR project, the interaction systems and the base gameplay for a cooking experience.$q$, ARRAY[$q$VR interactions for tools, ingredients and kitchen objects$q$, $q$OpenXR and Oculus setup$q$, $q$Project structure with scenes, prefabs and gameplay scripts$q$, $q$Materials and particle effects for visual feedback$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Solo$q$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[$q$Hand based interaction with kitchen items$q$, $q$Physics driven objects$q$, $q$Oculus headset support$q$, $q$Custom materials and effects$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Built on the VR Interaction Framework$q$, $q$Physics driven handling of tools and ingredients$q$, $q$OpenXR and Oculus XR packages configured for headset input$q$]::text[], $q$PC VR$q$, false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
