VALUES (gen_random_uuid()::text, $q$warpath-dark-ops$q$, $q$Warpath: Dark OPS$q$, $q$A real-time strategy game where enemy factions are driven by AI decision trees. Built at MangoMango Games by a small team of two developers and a game designer.$q$, $q$Simulation$q$, ARRAY[$q$RTS$q$, $q$Strategy$q$, $q$Enemy AI$q$, $q$Decision Trees$q$, $q$Unity$q$]::text[], $q$Unity, C#$q$, $q$2025$q$, $q$⚔️$q$, $q$#1e293b$q$, true, 16, $q$GAME$q$, $q$COMPANY$q$, $q$Gameplay developer$q$, $q$Worked as one of two developers on a small team with a technical lead and a game designer. I built the tutorial that introduces new players to the strategy gameplay.$q$, ARRAY[$q$Player tutorial and onboarding flow for the strategy gameplay$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Technical lead$q$, $q$Me, developer$q$, $q$One game designer$q$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[$q$Real-time strategy gameplay$q$, $q$Enemy factions with AI decision trees$q$, $q$Guided player tutorial$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Enemy faction behaviour driven by AI decision trees$q$]::text[], NULL, false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
